@startuml
title Green Rides UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login
Login : entry / getInfo
Login : do / verifyData
Login : exit / verified --> JourneyDetails
Login : exit / invalid --> LoggedOut

state LoginDecision <<choice>>
Login --> LoginDecision
LoginDecision : [valid] --> JourneyDetails
LoginDecision : [invalid] --> LoggedOut

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / user selects destination
JourneyDetails : do / display journey details
JourneyDetails : exit / user chooses option --> DrivingModeChoice
JourneyDetails : exit / no_journey --> NoJourney

state DiningChoice <<choice>>
DiningChoice --> EatPlaceSelection
DiningChoice : [no_hunger] --> NoHunger

state EatPlaceSelection
EatPlaceSelection : entry / user selects place to eat
EatPlaceSelection : do / display menu and allow order placement
EatPlaceSelection : exit / order placed or no hunger --> DiningChoice

state AccidentReporting
AccidentReporting : entry / accident occurs
AccidentReporting : do / inform relevant authorities
AccidentReporting : exit / report sent --> AccessEnded

state Notification
Notification : entry / driving or accident
Notification : do / send notifications
Notification : exit / notifications sent --> DrivingMode

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / journey completed
Feedback : do / allow user to provide feedback
Feedback : exit / feedback received --> LoggedOut

state LoggedOut
LoggedOut : entry / user logs out
LoggedOut : do / logout process
LoggedOut : exit / logged out
@enduml
